/* Personal site. Quiet on purpose.
   Body on paper, links in lagoon.
   Do not "correct" paper to #ffffff. */

:root {
  --ink:    #1c1415;
  --paper:  #f6f1ea;
  --muted:  #6b645c;
  --rule:   #d9d0c4;
  --link:   #2d7a99;
}

body {
  color: var(--ink);
  background: var(--paper);
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
}

a { color: var(--link); }
hr { border-color: var(--rule); }

h1 { letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
.caption { color: var(--muted); }

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root { --paper: #1c1415; --ink: #f6f1ea; }
}

# **Sunset**

Lagoon to coral. Warm afternoon light. Eight steps. Do not skip.

`#3e9cbf`  `#72c5d7`  `#a7ecf2`  `#d9e4b0`  `#f2c43d`  `#f1a33a`  `#f17c37`  `#f26d50`

Straw `#d9e4b0` is the hinge. Gold `#f2c43d` is noon, not body. Coral `#f26d50` is the last light. Lagoon `#3e9cbf` holds the sky.

### **Ramp**

```css
:root {
  --lagoon:    #3e9cbf;
  --shallows:  #72c5d7;
  --seaglass:  #a7ecf2;
  --straw:     #d9e4b0;
  --gold:      #f2c43d;
  --amber:     #f1a33a;
  --ember:     #f17c37;
  --coral:     #f26d50;
}
```

### **Still open**

